      "message": "That does work. Right now both the dim layer and udfps layers uses TYPE_NAVIGATION_BAR_PANEL. After i changed the dimlayer to something higher up like that of TYPE_DISPLAY_OVERLAY, it changed to device composition. Even though I set custom zorder for the dim layer, that didn\u0027t have any effect on composition but altering the WindowType did.\n\nHowever, based on stock zordering,the dim layer is supposed to be the lowest of all\n\n| Bit index | Decimal | Layer       | Z-order      |\n| --------- | ------- | ----------- | ------------ |\n| 0         | 1       | **dim**     | `0x41000005` |\n| 1         | 2       | **pressed** | `0x41000033` |\n| 2         | 4       | **icon**    | `0x41000032` |\n| 3         | 8       | **aod**     | `0x41000011` |",
